{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     Find and grab object. If grabbed, process it. Release. If not visible, scan area.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = ReleaseObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    />\"",
